289
00:16:58,639 --> 00:17:00,679
Why aren't you showing at all?

290
00:17:03,080 --> 00:17:06,079
You ate Grandma's bird's nest today?

291
00:17:09,160 --> 00:17:12,119
Heard Second Uncle added an Abortifacient.

292
00:17:15,640 --> 00:17:17,880
Pregnant women can't take Abortifacient.

293
00:17:19,759 --> 00:17:21,880
Is Auntie's baby doing okay?

294
00:17:48,039 --> 00:17:48,839
Hello.

295
00:17:50,039 --> 00:17:51,839
There's something I need you to do for me.

296
00:17:52,200 --> 00:17:54,039
Once it's done, I'll send you abroad

297
00:17:54,480 --> 00:17:55,920
and give you a large sum of money.

298
00:17:56,039 --> 00:17:57,599
Enough to last you a lifetime.

299
00:18:07,119 --> 00:18:07,920
Mr. Cheng.

300
00:18:08,119 --> 00:18:09,519
You lost a lot of blood back then,

301
00:18:09,759 --> 00:18:11,359
your family gave you a blood transfusion.

302
00:18:11,759 --> 00:18:12,559
Thank you.

303
00:18:13,119 --> 00:18:13,920
You're welcome.

304
00:18:18,920 --> 00:18:20,519
My oldest brother has Type AB blood.

305
00:18:21,599 --> 00:18:23,799
He can't have a child with Type O blood.

306
00:18:24,119 --> 00:18:26,359
So how could Sang Luo have Type O blood?

307
00:18:31,640 --> 00:18:32,799
You're not Sang Luo.

308
00:18:35,839 --> 00:18:37,200
Then who exactly are you?

309
00:18:41,839 --> 00:18:43,160
One last piece of advice.

310
00:18:43,519 --> 00:18:45,759
Look closer at those around you sometimes.

311
00:18:46,039 --> 00:18:47,759
I've already lost the person I care about.

312
00:18:48,440 --> 00:18:50,000
Hope you don't make the same mistake.

313
00:18:50,160 --> 00:18:51,400
Uncle, you can turn away

314
00:18:51,400 --> 00:18:53,000
someone walking the same path as you.

315
00:18:53,240 --> 00:18:54,079
But turning away someone

316
00:18:54,079 --> 00:18:55,880
who is trying hard to keep pace with you

317
00:18:56,640 --> 00:18:57,839
is just too cold.

318
00:18:58,440 --> 00:18:59,599
For the rest of my life,

319
00:19:00,319 --> 00:19:01,920
I want to walk the same path as you.

320
00:19:03,599 --> 00:19:05,759
And I'll try my best to keep pace with you.

321
00:19:09,559 --> 00:19:11,559
I once truly fell in love with someone.

322
00:19:12,480 --> 00:19:15,000
And that was my biggest regret.

323
00:19:18,400 --> 00:19:19,079
What's wrong with her?

324
00:19:19,079 --> 00:19:19,920
Is she okay?

325
00:19:20,519 --> 00:19:21,559
She had some of my mulberry wine.

326
00:19:22,000 --> 00:19:22,920
She might have had too much.

327
00:19:23,200 --> 00:19:24,000
Xiaowei.

328
00:19:24,680 --> 00:19:25,200
Xiaowei.

329
00:19:25,640 --> 00:19:26,160
Xiaowei.

330
00:19:29,559 --> 00:19:30,359
Xiaowei.

331
00:19:31,759 --> 00:19:32,839
Is it really you?

332
00:19:41,039 --> 00:19:42,119
If it is you,

333
00:19:43,720 --> 00:19:45,240
what have you been through?

334
00:19:46,559 --> 00:19:47,359
Xiaowei.

335
00:19:54,279 --> 00:19:55,079
Hello, Ms. Lin.

336
00:19:55,200 --> 00:19:55,880
Hello, Ms. Lin.

337
00:20:18,200 --> 00:20:19,000
Wanmei,

338
00:20:19,200 --> 00:20:20,000
Look over there.

339
00:20:21,119 --> 00:20:22,400
I'm going to build an estate.

340
00:20:22,839 --> 00:20:24,039
It will one day be the world's

341
00:20:24,039 --> 00:20:25,720
most exclusive wine club.

342
00:20:26,200 --> 00:20:27,279
I'll also set up

343
00:20:27,279 --> 00:20:28,839
a premium wine cabinet inside.

344
00:20:29,480 --> 00:20:31,000
You can keep all your creations

345
00:20:31,000 --> 00:20:31,960
in there.

346
00:20:32,279 --> 00:20:33,400
There will also be a bar

347
00:20:33,640 --> 00:20:34,960
facing the sunset.

348
00:20:35,400 --> 00:20:36,799
We can sip wine there.

349
00:20:37,519 --> 00:20:38,240
Really?

350
00:20:38,240 --> 00:20:38,960
I mean it.

351
00:20:39,359 --> 00:20:40,400
My brother already promised

352
00:20:40,400 --> 00:20:41,480
to fund it for me.

353
00:20:41,960 --> 00:20:42,880
I'm grateful to your brother.

354
00:20:44,240 --> 00:20:46,039
But I also promised my brother

355
00:20:46,279 --> 00:20:47,720
to work for Gufeng for ten years.

356
00:20:48,200 --> 00:20:49,240
We're both still young.

357
00:20:49,480 --> 00:20:50,440
It's all worth it.

358
00:20:56,319 --> 00:20:58,880
I want the whole wine world to know

359
00:21:00,240 --> 00:21:01,839
about your talent, Lin Wanmei.

360
00:21:12,160 --> 00:21:13,319
This Laijin Club...

361
00:21:13,319 --> 00:21:15,799
you closed it for three years at its peak.

362
00:21:16,079 --> 00:21:16,920
I thought

363
00:21:16,920 --> 00:21:19,000
you made it a shrine to win her back.

364
00:21:19,200 --> 00:21:20,839
Why did you suddenly decide to reopen it?

365
00:21:22,759 --> 00:21:24,759
Laijin holds too many of our memories.

366
00:21:27,279 --> 00:21:28,200
After she left,

367
00:21:29,319 --> 00:21:31,240
these memories instead became

368
00:21:31,240 --> 00:21:33,720
the most painful torture deep in my heart.

369
00:21:34,519 --> 00:21:35,440
Welcome.

370
00:21:41,640 --> 00:21:42,559
But now,

371
00:21:43,799 --> 00:21:45,000
it seems she has returned.

372
00:21:45,880 --> 00:21:46,680
Right.

373
00:21:46,799 --> 00:21:48,160
Still a club to win her back.

374
00:21:49,079 --> 00:21:49,880
But Cheng An,

375
00:21:49,960 --> 00:21:51,039
are you out of your mind?

376
00:21:51,240 --> 00:21:52,759
Even if she isn't your niece,

377
00:21:52,759 --> 00:21:54,519
you can't just use her as a substitute.

378
00:21:56,880 --> 00:21:58,680
Maybe it's a blessing from above.

379
00:22:00,640 --> 00:22:02,000
But as long as Xiaowei can come back,

380
00:22:02,240 --> 00:22:03,960
even if the chance is one in a million,

381
00:22:04,839 --> 00:22:05,920
I want to try.

382
00:22:19,839 --> 00:22:21,319
Compared to Fengtang Club,

383
00:22:21,519 --> 00:22:22,720
how do you like it here?

384
00:22:23,279 --> 00:22:24,400
What do you think, Ms. Lin?

385
00:22:28,359 --> 00:22:29,400
Both have their merits.

386
00:22:59,359 --> 00:23:00,160
Come on.

387
00:23:09,400 --> 00:23:10,200
Sang Luo.

388
00:23:17,039 --> 00:23:18,079
They have some good wine here.

389
00:23:18,079 --> 00:23:18,640
I'll go take a look.

390
00:23:18,640 --> 00:23:19,279
Okay.

391
00:23:40,799 --> 00:23:42,680
Teaching me to choose wine, Mr. Cheng?

392
00:23:43,279 --> 00:23:45,279
I don't recall sending you an invitation.

393
00:23:46,119 --> 00:23:48,039
For Mr. Yi to show up uninvited...

394
00:23:48,039 --> 00:23:49,920
isn't that a bit presumptuous?

395
00:23:51,119 --> 00:23:52,240
I'm not here as Mr. Yi today.

396
00:23:53,759 --> 00:23:55,039
Today, my role is

397
00:23:56,240 --> 00:23:57,640
Sang Luo's date.

398
00:24:01,640 --> 00:24:03,000
Since I'm here with Sang Luo,

399
00:24:03,160 --> 00:24:04,640
I suppose I should call Mr. Cheng...

400
00:24:05,160 --> 00:24:06,200
"Uncle."

401
00:24:07,599 --> 00:24:08,480
Uncle.

402
00:24:09,480 --> 00:24:10,079
Then, Mr. Yi,

403
00:24:10,079 --> 00:24:11,759
shouldn't you learn

404
00:24:12,519 --> 00:24:14,240
how to behave at someone else's party

405
00:24:14,759 --> 00:24:16,279
and be a proper accessory?

406
00:24:19,799 --> 00:24:21,200
Then why don't you tell me, Mr. Cheng,

407
00:24:21,559 --> 00:24:23,200
what makes a proper accessory?

408
00:24:29,880 --> 00:24:31,200
What are you two talking about?

409
00:24:31,960 --> 00:24:32,759
Nothing.

410
00:24:33,440 --> 00:24:34,400
Uncle was just praising

411
00:24:34,400 --> 00:24:35,720
the tie you picked out for me,

412
00:24:35,720 --> 00:24:37,599
saying it's stylish and tasteful.

413
00:24:38,920 --> 00:24:39,920
I really like it too.

414
00:24:43,880 --> 00:24:45,279
It really suits you.

415
00:24:48,240 --> 00:24:48,960
Uncle here has

416
00:24:48,960 --> 00:24:50,839
a lot of fine vintage wines.

417
00:24:51,319 --> 00:24:52,160
I'll show you around.

418
00:24:54,359 --> 00:24:55,160
Sure.

419
00:24:56,319 --> 00:24:56,880
Let's go.

420
00:24:56,880 --> 00:24:57,680
Uncle.

421
00:25:03,519 --> 00:25:04,440
Sorry about that.

422
00:25:04,799 --> 00:25:06,359
I made your uncle mad.

423
00:25:06,599 --> 00:25:07,400
You didn't.

424
00:25:10,240 --> 00:25:11,039
Ten o'clock.

425
00:25:11,119 --> 00:25:12,440
Tasting Room 8.

426
00:25:12,519 --> 00:25:13,599
I have something for you.

427
00:25:13,960 --> 00:25:14,759
What is it?

428
00:25:17,519 --> 00:25:18,319
It's nothing.

429
00:25:18,920 --> 00:25:19,920
Just a spam message.

430
00:25:20,720 --> 00:25:21,519
Let's go.

431
00:25:54,000 --> 00:25:54,799
What are you doing here?

432
00:25:56,960 --> 00:25:58,079
I knew it.

433
00:25:58,079 --> 00:26:00,039
You still remember our promise.

434
00:26:00,119 --> 00:26:00,920
Lin Wanmei.

435
00:26:01,680 --> 00:26:03,720
I'm in no mood to reminisce right now.

436
00:26:04,160 --> 00:26:05,599
This is no place for you.

437
00:26:07,119 --> 00:26:08,960
Are you still blaming me

438
00:26:09,440 --> 00:26:11,400
for breaking our promise back then?

439
00:26:12,279 --> 00:26:13,960
You know I had my reasons.

440
00:26:14,440 --> 00:26:15,480
A woman

441
00:26:15,480 --> 00:26:17,279
only has so many decades.

442
00:26:17,480 --> 00:26:18,279
Cheng An,

443
00:26:23,440 --> 00:26:24,319
Ye Xiaowei...

444
00:26:25,839 --> 00:26:26,680
You want to transfer the club's shares

445
00:26:26,680 --> 00:26:28,400
to a dead person?

446
00:26:29,000 --> 00:26:29,720
So what?

447
00:26:29,720 --> 00:26:31,039
Are you crazy, Cheng An?

448
00:26:31,039 --> 00:26:32,839
She's been dead for three years.

449
00:26:38,559 --> 00:26:39,839
You love Ye Xiaowei.

450
00:26:40,240 --> 00:26:41,400
Then what am I?

451
00:26:42,440 --> 00:26:44,000
You said you'd have the wine I made

452
00:26:44,000 --> 00:26:45,480
fill your winery.

453
00:26:45,599 --> 00:26:46,880
You said you'd let everyone

454
00:26:46,880 --> 00:26:48,319
see my talent.

455
00:26:48,480 --> 00:26:50,160
You filled the room with Night Breeze.

456
00:26:50,160 --> 00:26:51,559
Wasn't that just to tell me

457
00:26:51,559 --> 00:26:52,960
that you still love me?

458
00:27:02,799 --> 00:27:03,839
It was an oversight on my part.

459
00:27:05,400 --> 00:27:06,640
I forgot to have the staff

460
00:27:06,640 --> 00:27:08,799
remove your wine from the list.

461
00:27:10,240 --> 00:27:11,039
Lin Wanmei,

462
00:27:12,160 --> 00:27:13,880
the feelings between us

463
00:27:15,000 --> 00:27:17,160
died the moment you crawled

464
00:27:17,160 --> 00:27:18,839
into my older brother's bed.

465
00:27:18,839 --> 00:27:20,039
Laijin's existence

466
00:27:20,319 --> 00:27:22,319
has absolutely nothing to do with you.

467
00:27:22,319 --> 00:27:23,359
Now get the hell out of here!

468
00:27:26,160 --> 00:27:27,119
How about this, Cheng An...

469
00:27:27,720 --> 00:27:29,799
Why don't you try being with me again?

470
00:27:30,200 --> 00:27:31,000
For one month?

471
00:27:31,000 --> 00:27:31,680
Get out!

472
00:27:31,720 --> 00:27:32,759
One week?

473
00:27:32,759 --> 00:27:33,240
Even just one...

474
00:27:33,240 --> 00:27:34,240
I said, get out!

475
00:28:21,119 --> 00:28:22,640
Why didn't you reply to my messages?

476
00:28:27,680 --> 00:28:28,480
Let go.

477
00:28:30,440 --> 00:28:31,400
I said let go.

478
00:28:33,480 --> 00:28:34,480
I told you to let go!

479
00:28:35,200 --> 00:28:36,240
Yi Kai, what are you doing?

480
00:28:37,559 --> 00:28:38,359
Let go!

481
00:28:39,799 --> 00:28:41,319
Let's not make a scene, okay?

482
00:28:58,960 --> 00:28:59,759
Wanmei,

483
00:29:36,680 --> 00:29:38,119
If you're drunk, go back to sleep.

484
00:29:38,200 --> 00:29:39,680
Don't make a drunk fool of yourself here.

485
00:29:41,519 --> 00:29:42,640
You are her, aren't you?

486
00:29:45,359 --> 00:29:46,599
What nonsense are you talking about?

487
00:29:46,599 --> 00:29:47,400
You are her.

488
00:29:47,720 --> 00:29:48,759
I'm Sang Luo.

489
00:29:49,359 --> 00:29:50,759
My identity has already been

490
00:29:50,759 --> 00:29:51,839
confirmed over and over again.

491
00:29:52,920 --> 00:29:53,680
I know.

492
00:29:55,200 --> 00:29:57,119
I know there's more to three years ago.

493
00:29:58,920 --> 00:29:59,640
These past three years,

494
00:30:00,200 --> 00:30:01,240
where have you been?

495
00:30:02,759 --> 00:30:03,880
What have you been doing?

496
00:30:06,160 --> 00:30:06,960
Where were you?

497
00:30:10,200 --> 00:30:12,119
I prepared this for you three years ago.

498
00:30:13,039 --> 00:30:14,359
I wanted you to have a home.

499
00:30:19,000 --> 00:30:19,920
Laijin Club is

500
00:30:20,319 --> 00:30:21,640
the home I prepared for you.

501
00:30:28,119 --> 00:30:28,799
Ye Xiaowei,

502
00:30:32,319 --> 00:30:33,440
it's you.

503
00:30:34,160 --> 00:30:35,240
Just admit it, okay?

504
00:30:36,160 --> 00:30:37,000
You are her.

505
00:30:38,119 --> 00:30:39,039
Just admit it,

506
00:30:40,240 --> 00:30:41,160
okay?
